Even though Apple's all-new <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/apple-homeview/">HomeView</a> smart home display has <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/16/apple-homeview-smart-home-hub-has-some-issues/">several bugs</a>, customers ordering the device now might face a long wait for delivery.<br/>
