  <li><strong>Space Gray:</strong> December 16 - December 23</li><br/>
  <li><strong>Starlight:</strong> December 23 - January 5</li><br/>
  <li><strong>Rose Pink:</strong> January 5 - January 12</li><br/>
</ul><br/>
<br/>
